# Product-Docs Workflow Bootstrap

When a user introduces a **new idea**, follow root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) § **Fresh-session workflow bootstrap (product-docs method)** — that section is the single full procedure (lanes, skills, retention gate).

Do not maintain a second copy of the skill list or lane steps here.

Quick orientation only:

- Prefer **Plan mode** for ideation and trade-offs; **Agent mode** for writing artifacts and implementation.
- Shortest method entry: `product-docs/methodology/minimum-viable-method.md` or `session-start-guide.md`.
- Closeout: classify **hygiene vs program** before inventing `I-*` / `TB-*` (`minimum-viable-method.md`, decision `2026-06-06-methodological-closeout-vs-code-hygiene.md`).
- GitHub issues: `product-docs/methodology/github-issues-workflow.md` + [`.cursor/rules/github-issue-labels.mdc`](github-issue-labels.mdc) — labels at create time.
